;
; How Isobar files one node of its site tree in MYRA (isobar_rules.h
; IR5): a tree kept as a sparse record under the parent's number (0 for
; a network, the root) and the node's own, with its kind (1 a network,
; 2 a site that holds stations) and its elevation in metres. The model
; asks whether the numbers fit before it keeps the node.
^ZXISOSITE(parent:i4, site:i4) = kind:i1! ^ elev:i5!
